  <para style="h">Jialatai Kunlade Huaisan Xin</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jialatai Kunlade Huaisan Xin</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jialatai</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jia</para>
  <para style="mt">Jialatai Kunlade Huaisan Xin</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1"/>
  <para style="s">Kielien Asazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1"/>Shitu danlasan bi <char style="pn">Baolo</char> xin huaizho. Bi shitu danlakushi kun peisan pusho, kunni tungo giesanye pusho, <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexiha pse hhei fugusan kun dundase aminne olughasan Ada Hudai tungo giezhi peisan wo. <verse eid="GAL 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2"/>Bi mare hhantulasan gaijiularene man <char style="png">Jialatai</char>ni jiohuilade kielien asaye. <verse eid="GAL 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3"/>Mai Ada Huda, Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexiha tande nenjien, pinnan ogi gie! <verse eid="GAL 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4"/>Huda mai Adai isighala Mexiha ene doghun duyase mai andaghane giezhi mai zuide oluzhi goyane sheiwo. <verse eid="GAL 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5"/>Kuaikui chanqi izhi Hudade ogi. Amine!<verse eid="GAL 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pse Gouxioxi Uwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6"/>Mexihani nenjienyi tungo giezhi tai urusan Hudase ta deigo likai giedene psedu gouxioxini daghase bi ghanirazho. <verse eid="GAL 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7"/>Shijishan psedu gouxioxi uwo, niezhan kunla tai londaghazhi Mexihani gouxioxii geine giezho. <verse eid="GAL 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8"/>Bugon bijien, asiman jierese iresan qienxienliuzhe bijien tande chonjisan gouxioxii buxiantui chonjise hhei indan kharakui wo. <verse eid="GAL 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9"/>Bijien melieshida kieliezhi daozho, ede bi pse kielieye. Kienliuzhe ta jienliesan gouxioxii buxiantui tande chonjise hhei indan kharakui wo.<verse eid="GAL 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10"/>Ede bi kunlai kuaighanu, Hudai kuaighane? Bi kunlai bayasughane giezhou? Bi dou kunlai bayasughane giese bishi Mexihani hoji pusho.<verse eid="GAL 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baolo Shitu Gholusan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11"/>Gaijiula, bi chonjisan gouxioxishi kunse iresan pusho bikui ta mejie. <verse eid="GAL 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12"/>Hheshi bi kunlase jienliesan pusho, kunla sughasanye pusho, <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexiha mejieghasan wo.<verse eid="GAL 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13"/>Bi melieshida Yutaijiode matugie udu daosanyi ta chenliezhi daozho. Bi Hudai jiohuini hende heizhi widaghane giezho. <verse eid="GAL 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14"/>Yutaijio fanmiende bi goya minzune nie nasuntu kunlase zui fama wo, mii xienrenla zunjisan xigonde zui rexin wo. <verse eid="GAL 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15"/>Ingiezhoma, Huda nenjienghalane mii oluku melie sunghuzhi urudene <verse eid="GAL 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16"/>niman kunlade <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i chonjighane giezhi kewonne made bayasuzhi uzheghazho. Ingiekude bi kunlare shanlian ese gie, <verse eid="GAL 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17"/>mase melie shitu danlasan kunlade asane giezhi <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de ese khirei, deigo <char style="png">Alabo</char>de echidene pse <char style="png">Damashige</char>de khareiwo.<verse eid="GAL 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18"/>Ingie 3 nien daodene bi <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de khirei, <char style="pn">Jifa</char>i tani, hhere hhantu 15 qien souwo. <verse eid="GAL 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19"/>Zinie Ezhanyi jiuni <char style="pn">Yagebu</char>se chugo psedu shitulai nieda ese chanlawo. <verse eid="GAL 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20"/>Bi tande huaisanshi man shuhua wo. Bi Hudai melie ghudan ulie kieliene. <verse eid="GAL 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21"/>Khuinashi bi <char style="png">Xiliya</char>, <char style="png">Jilijia</char> oronde echiwo. <verse eid="GAL 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22"/>Hhe xienzide Mexihai xianxin giesan <char style="png">Yudaya</char>ni jiohuila mii chanlazhi ese daozho. <verse eid="GAL 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23"/>Hhela zinie melieshida mai heisan kun ede hhe melieshida widaghane giesan xinyanni chonjizho giesei chenliedene <verse eid="GAL 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24"/>mii yenyin jiere Hudai kuaizho.<verse eid="GAL 1:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2"/>
  <para style="s">Psedu Shitula Baoloi Renjiwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1"/>14 nien daodene bi <char style="pn">Banaba</char>ghala <char style="pn">Qido</char>i uduru pse <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de khireiwo. <verse eid="GAL 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2"/>Bi khireikushi Huda made mejieghazho. Bi hhezighan lindaolai konkonji chujieghedene bi niman kunlade gouxioxi chonjisei kieliezhi minbai olughakushi bi melieshida, ede belien ese holuse giezho. <verse eid="GAL 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3"/>Mare hhantu echisan <char style="pn">Qido</char>shi <char style="png">Xila</char> kun woma, hhei biizhi hetoune ese gieghazho. <verse eid="GAL 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4"/>Enei kieliekushi niezhan jia gaijiula ghulazhi orozhedene konkonji Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i miendedu bijienyi ziyui uzhedene bijienyi hoji danlaghane giezho. <verse eid="GAL 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5"/>Bijien gouxioxini zhendaoi tai dunda beighane giezhi hhelade goujida ese ranjiwo. <verse eid="GAL 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6"/>Hhezighan lindao danlasanla bi chonjisan daolide yama ese jiaizho. Hhela eqighandei yan kun bikui made yama zoin uwo, Huda mienzighala ulie uzhene. <verse eid="GAL 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7"/>Khareidene Huda <char style="pn">Beduru</char>de hetoune giesan kunlade gouxioxini chonjiku renwuni ogiku mutun madeye hetoune ese giesan kunlade chonjiku renwui ogisei hhela uzhe khizhewo. <verse eid="GAL 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8"/><char style="pn">Beduru</char>i sudoro wilie giezhi hhei hetoune giesan kunlade shitu danlaghasan hhe mii sudoroye wilie giezhi mii niman kunlade shitu danlaghawo. <verse eid="GAL 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9"/>Jiohuini tuhuade sanasan <char style="pn">Yagebu</char>, <char style="pn">Jifa</char>, <char style="pn">Yaheiya</char> enela Huda made ogisan nenjienyi chenren giedene bi <char style="pn">Banaba</char>ghalade borun khane ogizhi lienshou gholu, bijien niman kunlai dunda echi, hhela hetoune giesan kunlai dunda echikui tunyi oluwo. <verse eid="GAL 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10"/>Hhela zinie bijienyi yoqiu giezhi nanxin kunlai jilazhi banman gie giezho. Ene shiqinyi yenlai bi xiacha giezhi giezho.<verse eid="GAL 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baolo Bedurui Kheilazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11"/>Khuinashi <char style="pn">Jifa</char> <char style="png">Anqiya</char>de irekude ulie giekui giese bi danmien hhei fandui giewo. <verse eid="GAL 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12"/><char style="pn">Yagebu</char>i hhense irechen kunla ese kuzhekude <char style="pn">Jifa</char> niman kunlare hhantu ijiezho. Hhela irese ijinyo hetoune gie giesan <char style="png">Yutai</char>ni Mexihai xianxin giesan kunlase ayidene tui gholodowo. <verse eid="GAL 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13"/>Psedu <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla hhei daghazhi jiazhon giezho, lien <char style="pn">Banaba</char>ye shandan giedene hhelai daghazhi jiazhon giezho. <verse eid="GAL 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14"/>Bi chanlase hhelai giesan gouxioxini zhendaoghala buxianshi dajialai melie <char style="pn">Jifa</char>de kieliewo, "Chishi nie <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun bidene <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunnughunyi ulie daghadene niman kunnughunyi daghase matugie niman kunlai biizhi <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunnughunyi daghaghane?"<verse eid="GAL 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yutai Kun Niman Kunlai Man Xianxin Giekughala Jiuine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15"/>Matanshi nangha pusho, olusanse <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun enbene. <verse eid="GAL 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16"/>Kunyi gounide sanakushi guijinni zunjikughala pusho, <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani xianxin giekughala bikui matan mejiene. Matanye Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i xianxin giekushi guijinni zunjikughala pusho, Mexihai xianxin giekughala gounide sanaghaku wo. Kiemada guijinni zunjizhi gounide sanasei uwo. <verse eid="GAL 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17"/>Matan Mexihai tungo giezhi gounide sanaghane giedene goyaneye zuiren gholuse Mexihashi mai zui fanjighachen onu? Kenjin pusho! <verse eid="GAL 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18"/>Bi cheisanne pse erchan giese goyaneshi zuiren bikui zhenmin giewo. <verse eid="GAL 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19"/>Bi guijinni tungo giezhi guijinse fugudene Hudade amiturawo. <verse eid="GAL 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20"/>Bi Mexihaghalai hhantu shizijia jiere ijin ghadawo. Ede amiturasanshi bi pusho, Mexiha mii sudoro amiturazho. Bi beye jiere amiturasanshi made orezhi made oluzhi goyane sheisan Hudai kewonni xianxin giesanghala amiturazho. <verse eid="GAL 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21"/>Bi Hudai nenjienyi ulie widaghane. Guijinni tungo giezhi gundanni irezhoshi Mexiha belien duya ijiewo.<verse eid="GAL 2:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3"/>
  <para style="s">Guijin Onu Xianxin Gieku Wo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1"/>
    <char style="png">Jialatai</char>ni guazi kunlaya! Kien tai miiwo? <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani shizijia jiere ghadazhi qinchude tai melie beilawo. <verse eid="GAL 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2"/>Bi tande jianie shiqin asaye, ta Shenlinni jienliesanshi guijinni zunjikughala onu gouxioxini sonosudene xianxin giekughala wo? <verse eid="GAL 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3"/>Ta Shenlinghala kaishi giedene beyeghala jieshu olughanu? Tashi intu guazi onu? <verse eid="GAL 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4"/>Ta imeghei shouku giesanshi belienni onu? Bebelieghanji onu? <verse eid="GAL 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5"/>Huda tande Shenlinni ogizhi tai dunda nenlitu shiqin giesanshi ta guijinni zunjikughala onu gouxioxini sonosudene xianxin giekughala wo? <verse eid="GAL 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6"/>Jinwun jiere jilasan mutun, "<char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char> Hudai xianxin giedene Huda hhei gounide sanazho."<verse eid="GAL 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7"/>Ingiese xianxin giesanlashi <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char>i houdei bikui ta mejie. <verse eid="GAL 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8"/>Niman kunlai xianxin giekughala Huda gounide sanakui jinwun jiere melie kieliezho. Ingie eqighanse <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char>de gouxioxini chonjizhi kieliezho, "Chii tungo giezhi soyuji minzulade fuqi irene." <verse eid="GAL 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9"/>Ingiese xianxin giesan kunla xianxin giesan <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char>re hhantu fuqi jienliene. <verse eid="GAL 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10"/>Guijinni zunjikude kouisan kunla man kharaku doura wo. Jinwun jiere jilasan mutun, "Guijinshu jiere jilasanlai man ulie zunjizhi ulie giesanlai man kharane." <verse eid="GAL 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11"/>Guijinni kouizhi kiemai Hudai melie gounide sana daku qinchu wo. Jinwun jiere kieliezho, "Gou kun xianxin giekughala amiturane." <verse eid="GAL 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12"/>Guijin xianxin giekughala buxian wo. Jinwun jiere kieliesan mutun, "Guijinni zunjisan kunla guijinni kouizhi amiturane." <verse eid="GAL 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13"/>Jien mutun jiere gualasanlai kharane giezhi jinwun jiere jilasan mutun Mexiha matande oluzhi kharakui shouizhi guijinni kharakuse matai shuiwo. <verse eid="GAL 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14"/>Ingiedene <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char>de ogisan fuqi Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i tungo giezhi niman kunlade kuruwo, matan xianxin giekui tungo giezhi dain giesan Shenlinni jienliewo.<verse eid="GAL 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Guijin Dain Giesanghala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15"/>Gaijiula, bi nie pinchanku bifanyi kielieye. Kun kielien yenjise kiema widagha daji jiai dane. <verse eid="GAL 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16"/>Huda <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char>, hhei houdeide dain giekude olon kunyi zhiizhi chii houdeila giezhi ese kieliedene niekozii zhiizhi chii houdei giezho. Hheshi Mexiha wo. <verse eid="GAL 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17"/>Mii isishi ingiezho. 430 nien daodene iresan guijin melieshida Huda yenjisei widagha dazhi dain giesei widagha dane. <verse eid="GAL 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18"/>Hudai jiachan guijinse irezhoshi dain giesanse ese irezho, ingieliuzhe Huda <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char>de dain giesei tungo giezhi ogizho. <verse eid="GAL 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19"/>Qinse guijinshi yan wo? Guijinshi <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char>de dain giesan houdei iretula zuini mejieghane giezhi jiaisan wo. Guijinshi qienxienlai tungo giezhi dundadu kunyi khai jingo giezhi jinjisan wo. <verse eid="GAL 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20"/>Dundadu kunshi shonfanmienyi daibio giezhoma, Hudashi nie wo.<verse eid="GAL 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Musani Guijinni Zoin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21"/>Ingiese guijin Hudai dain giesanghala zodui giezhou? Kenjin uye! Amin ireghaku guijinni ogizhoshi kunla hhei tungo giezhi gounide sanawo. <verse eid="GAL 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22"/>Ingiezhoma, soyuji kunlai zuide qienji jiezho giezhi jinwun jiere kieliezho. Ingiedene <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai xianxin giezhi iresan dainni xianxin giesan kunlade ogizho.<verse eid="GAL 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23"/>Xianxin gieku iretula matai guijin doura khazhi xianxin gieku xienjizhi khizhetula uzhezho. <verse eid="GAL 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24"/>Ingiese guijinshi Mexiha iretula mai uduruku loushi wo. Ingiedene xianxin giekughala mai gounide sanaghazho. <verse eid="GAL 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25"/>Ede xianxin gieku irese matan hhe uduruku loushii doura uwo.<verse eid="GAL 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26"/>Ta man Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i xianxin giekughala Hudai kewosi gholuwo. <verse eid="GAL 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27"/>Xilii jienliezhi Mexihare hhantulasan ta man jierene Mexihai musizho. <verse eid="GAL 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28"/>Ta Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i miende man nie wo. <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun, niman kun, ziyutu kun, hoji, ere kun, eme kunla yama chabie uwo. <verse eid="GAL 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29"/>Tashi Mexihanughunshi <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char>i houdei wo, dain giesanzhe caichanni jienliechen wo.<verse eid="GAL 3:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1"/>Bi kieliese jiachanshi man jienliechennughun woma, hhe kewosi xienzide hojilare yama chabie uwo. <verse eid="GAL 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2"/>Adani jinjisan shihou kuzhetula hhe izhi qiezhechen kun, gonjisan kunyi doura wo. <verse eid="GAL 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3"/>Matanye niekielien wo. Matan kewosi bikude ene duyani langan daoli matai gonjizhoma, <verse eid="GAL 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4"/>shihou onqienji kuzhese Huda kewonne peizhi eme kunyi tungo giezhi guijin doura ireghadene <verse eid="GAL 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5"/>guijin douradu kunlai shuizhi khizhe matande kewosi danlaku qienlii ogiwo. <verse eid="GAL 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6"/>Tashi kewosi wo, Huda Kewonne ruhherni peizhi mai zhughede teise matan Hudai Aba! Ada giezhi urune. <verse eid="GAL 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7"/>Ingiese chishi pse hoji pusho, kewon wo. Kewon enbese Huda renjisan jiachanyi jienliechen enbene.<verse eid="GAL 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baolo Jialatai Kunde Zhughe Chilazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8"/>Eqighandei ta Hudai tani dakude hhezighan yenlai Huda pushotulade hoji danlazhoma, <verse eid="GAL 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9"/>ede ta Hudai tanine, pse tashi Huda tanisan wo. Ta matugie pse hhezighan yama zoin witu bixin langan daolide hoji danlane giezhi daghazho? <verse eid="GAL 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10"/>Ta udu, sara, jieqi, nienjienni chigharade zunjizho. <verse eid="GAL 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11"/>Ingiese bi tande zhughe chilazhi khishulasan belien gholukuse ayizho.<verse eid="GAL 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12"/>Gaijiula, bi tai xiahua gieye, bi ta mutun gholusan mutun taye bi mutun gholu. Ta mii ese kuighazho. <verse eid="GAL 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13"/>Ta mejiene, bi giemerekuzhe caigie tande tou 1 hui gouxioxi chonjiwo. <verse eid="GAL 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14"/>Beyemi tande achan ogiwoma, ingieliuzhe ta mii gajide ese uzhezhi ese duisadene kharei Hudai qienxien mutun, Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char> mutun jienliewo. <verse eid="GAL 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15"/>Hhe xienzide ta hende bayasusan ede khala echiwo? Hhe xienzide ta nudunne waidene made ogiku duran bikui bi tande ganzhen bei shidane. <verse eid="GAL 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16"/>Ede bi tande zhendaoi kieliese tai duitou gholuwu? <verse eid="GAL 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17"/>Hhezighan kunla tande rexinde giezhoma, zhughedeni gou muji uwo. Tai mase gholodoghazhi goyadene rexinde gieghane giezho. <verse eid="GAL 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18"/>Gou mujighala tande rexinde giese gou wo. Enei zinie bi tai hhende bikude gieku pusho, chanqi giese olune. <verse eid="GAL 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19"/>Mii kesilaya, Mexihai yanzi tai sudoro gholutula bi tande oluzhi pse kewosi oluku kui shouizho. <verse eid="GAL 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20"/>Bi ede tanre hhantulane giezhi kouqine bienjighadene goude kieliekui hende duralakushi tande oluzhi zhughedemi nanran uwo.<verse eid="GAL 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hhazhire Sareghalai Bilazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21"/>Ta enezighan guijinni shunjine giesan kunla, made nie kielie, guijinde matui kieliesei ta ulie mejienu? <verse eid="GAL 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22"/>Jinwun jiere huaizho, <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char>de ghua kewon wo. Nieshi hoji bierei olusan wo. Nieshi ziyu bierei olusan wo. <verse eid="GAL 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23"/>Hoji bierei olusanshi beyei kouizhi oluzho, ziyu bierei olusanshi dain giesei kouizhi oluzho. <verse eid="GAL 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24"/>Eneshi bifan wo. Ghua biereishi ghua yenjisan kielien wo. Nie biereishi <char style="pn">Hhazhire</char> wo, <char style="png">Xinaishan</char>se irezhi olusan kesilashi hoji wo. <verse eid="GAL 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25"/><char style="pn">Hhazhire</char> <char style="png">Alabo</char>ni <char style="png">Xinaishan</char>ni daibio giezho, edeku <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>ghala niekielien wo. Hhe kesilarene manshi hoji wo. <verse eid="GAL 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26"/>Da nie biereishi asiman jieredu <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>ni daibio giezho. Hhe ziyu wo, matai ana wo. <verse eid="GAL 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27"/>Jinwun jiere huaizho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">"Kewosi olu dachen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">kewosi witu bierei, chi bayasu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Kewosi olusan tendunni ese shouisan bierei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">chi bayasuzhi jiuli!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Zhanguiji witu biereini kesila</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">zhanguiji bisan biereini kesilase olon wo!"<verse eid="GAL 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28"/>Gaijiula, tashi <char style="pn">Isaghei</char> mutun Huda dain giedene iresan kewosi wo. <verse eid="GAL 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29"/>Hhe shihoude beyese olusan Shenlinse olusei heizho. Edeye niekielien wo. <verse eid="GAL 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30"/>Ingiezhoma jinwun jiere matugie kieliezho? Hoji biereiji hhei kewonni tou khireigha. Hoji biereini kewon ziyu biereini kewonghala hhantu jiachanni jienliese ulie olune giezho. <verse eid="GAL 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31"/>Gaijiula, ingiese matanshi hoji biereini kewosi pusho, ziyu biereini kewosi wo.<verse eid="GAL 4:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1"/>Mexiha matanyi ziyude oluzhi matanyi andaghawo. Ingiese ta beizhi undanla. Hojini jiaban tai pse kunzhi bu gie gie.<verse eid="GAL 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mexihai Daghasan Kunlani Ziyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2"/>Ta chenliendu, bi <char style="pn">Baolo</char> tande goude kielieye. Ta hetoude kouise Mexiha tande yama haochu uwo. <verse eid="GAL 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3"/>Bi pse jien hetoune giesan kunlade jingao gieye. Tande guijinni man zunjiku zheren wine. <verse eid="GAL 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4"/>Ta enezighan guijinni kouizhi gounide sanane giesanla, Mexihaghala gonxi widazhi nenjiense likai giewo. <verse eid="GAL 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5"/>Bijien Shenlinde kouizhi xianxin giekughala gounide sanakui panjizhi sagheizho. <verse eid="GAL 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6"/>Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i miende hetoune gie, ulie gie yama zhunyo uwo. Zhunyonishi orekughala khizhesan xianxin gieku wo.<verse eid="GAL 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7"/>Ta izhi giesan gou woma, ede ta zhendaoni shunjikui kien duiwo? <verse eid="GAL 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8"/>Ingiezhi surughasanshi tai urusan hhe pusho. <verse eid="GAL 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9"/>Goujinie kunieghe nie duizi ghurunyi faighane. <verse eid="GAL 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10"/>Ta pseshikui ulie sumulakui bi Ezhanyi miende hende xianxin giezhoma, kien tai daolon giese hhei faine. <verse eid="GAL 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11"/>Gaijiula, bi izhigie hetoune giekui chonjizhoshi mii yangiezhi dou heine? Qingiezhoshi shizijia kunni hokurughaku widawo. <verse eid="GAL 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12"/>Bi xiwon giese tai daolon giesanla goyane atala gie!<verse eid="GAL 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13"/>Gaijiula, tai ziyude uruzhoma, ene ziyuni nefuxin gieku jihui bu gholughadene nieniene oreku zhugheghala ushila. <verse eid="GAL 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14"/>Soyuji guijin man goyadene mutun giebeidene ore giesan ene nie aman kieliende bouizho. <verse eid="GAL 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15"/>Ta xioxin giezhi nieniene bu zhouzhi bu yenji, pse man widane.<verse eid="GAL 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shenlin Tai Uduru Gie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16"/>Bi kielieye, ta Shenlinni daghazhi gie, ingiese beyeni nefuxinni ulie giene. <verse eid="GAL 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17"/>Beyeni nefuxin Shenlinghala zodui giezho, Shenlinye beyeghala zodui giezho. Ene ghuala nieniene zodui giezhi ta duralasan shiqinni ulie gieghane. <verse eid="GAL 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18"/>Tai Shenlin uduruse guijin doura uwo. <verse eid="GAL 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19"/>Beye giekulai minminji mejiene, lon kijieku, zannanni, hu gieku, <verse eid="GAL 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20"/>nigiedai beiiku, fashu shuaiku, chou bareiku, zhenjinduku, henjiku, piqi shuaiku, zinie goyane guiku, danlinraku, danpai gholughaku, <verse eid="GAL 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21"/>dubilieku, jiu ochi sudoku, nouiku, pse intu shiqinla wo. Bi eqighanse tande jingao giesan mutun ede pse tande jingao gieye. Enezighan shiqinlani giesan kunla Hudai gojiai jienlie dane.<verse eid="GAL 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22"/>Shenlinni jiegoshi, oreku, bayasuku, pinnan, rennai, goude gieku, gou zhughe, kekaoni, <verse eid="GAL 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23"/>renyi, goyane kunzhi gieku wo. Intu shiqinlai guijin gonji dane. <verse eid="GAL 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24"/>Mexiha <char style="pn">Ersa</char>ni kunla beyeji nefuxin gieku duranne hhantu shizijia jiere ghadawo. <verse eid="GAL 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25"/>Matan Shenlinni kouizhi udu daose Shenlinni kouizhi giekuni wo. <verse eid="GAL 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26"/>Matan goyane undude bu uzhezhi nieniene bu hokughazhi nieniene bu dubilieye.<verse eid="GAL 5:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6"/>
  <para style="s">Xianxin Giesan Kunni Zheren</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1"/>Gaijiula, nie kun zui fanjise ta Shenlini kouisan kunla renyitu zhugheghala hhei khareizhi daozhegha. Pse goyane miikui xioxin gie. <verse eid="GAL 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2"/>Ta nieniene achanyi banjizhi danjindu. Ingiezhi giese Mexihani guijinni chengun olughane. <verse eid="GAL 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3"/>Kun yama pushodene goyane hen wo giese goyane piendazho. <verse eid="GAL 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4"/>Jien kun goya giesan wilielane jiencha gie, ingiese bayasuku zinie goyade wo, kunlade uwo. <verse eid="GAL 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5"/>Jien kun goya zherenne goya danji. <verse eid="GAL 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6"/>Hudai kielienyi surusan kun surughasan kunde goude dunxilai man ogikuni wo. <verse eid="GAL 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7"/>Goyane bu pienda, Hudai meilade bu uzhe. Kun tareisanshi yan woshi ghurasanshi yan wo. <verse eid="GAL 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8"/>Zuitu beyene shunjizhi tareise zuitu beyese qida olukui ghurane, Shenlinni shunjizhi tareise Shenlinse chanqiku amin ghurane. <verse eid="GAL 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9"/>Matan gouni giekude fanqi bu giezhi zhazhen giema, heshitu shihou kuzhese ghurakui wine. <verse eid="GAL 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10"/>Ingiese matande jihui bikude dajialade gouni giekui wo, xianxin giesan nie gie kunlade genjia ingiezhi giekui wo.<verse eid="GAL 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zuihouku Kielien</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11"/>Uzhe, bi qinsi tande huaisan uru matu fugie wo. <verse eid="GAL 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12"/>Hhezighan mienzii kuaichen kunla tai biizhi hetoune gieghakushi zinie Mexihani shizijiai yenyin jiere heikuse ayizho. <verse eid="GAL 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13"/>Hhezighan hetoune giesan kunla goyalane guijinni ulie zunjidene tai hetoune gieghakushi tai beyei tungo giezhi goyane kuaine giezho. <verse eid="GAL 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14"/>Bi zinie matai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani shizijiase chugo psedulai ulie kuaisejiu. Shizijiai tungo giezhi bi fugusan mutun duyare gonxi widazho. Duyaye fugusan mutun mare gonxi widazho. <verse eid="GAL 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15"/>Hetoune gie, ulie gie yama zhunyo uwo. Zhunyonishi shini kun wo. <verse eid="GAL 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16"/>Jien ene daoli mutun giesan kunlade, Hudai Isilie bexinlade Huda pinnan, ubali xiikui ogi gie!<verse eid="GAL 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17"/>Enedu khuinase kiemada mii jiohoro bu gie, mii jiere <char style="pn">Ersa</char>ni hou wine.<verse eid="GAL 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18"/>Gaijiula, mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani nenjien tai zhughede bisejiu. Amine!<verse eid="GAL 6:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6"/>
</usx>
